Source: pg-opencc
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), cmake (>= 3.12), g++, python3
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/pgsty/pg_opencc

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-opencc
Architecture: any
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenCC Chinese conversion for PostgreSQL
 The opencc extension converts between Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese,
 Taiwan and Hong Kong conventions, and Japanese Shinjitai. OpenCC 1.4.2 and
 its dictionaries are embedded in the shared library, with no system OpenCC
 runtime dependency. Requires a UTF8 database and uses the fixed opencc schema.
